; RT48 / PT48 (#679). Expectations from ADR 0052 and PT48, calculated independently.
; Handwritten ellissi.dxf: one valid sentinel, zero axis, invalid ratios,
; unsupported extrusion. Raw groups stay identical.
D = DXF file=ellissi.dxf
; The valid sentinel makes this case pending until the ELLIPSE codec exists.
; cambia con #679
? count D -> ELLIPSE 1
? unhandled D -> ELLIPSE 5
? entity D 101 -> ELLIPSE center=10,20 major-axis=4,0 ratio=0.5
? entity D 102 -> unhandled ELLIPSE
? entity D 103 -> unhandled ELLIPSE
? entity D 104 -> unhandled ELLIPSE
? entity D 105 -> unhandled ELLIPSE
? entity D 106 -> unhandled ELLIPSE
? roundtrip D -> identical
? roundtrip D as=cadx -> identical
